## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
**Part A — Why This Company Can Compound:**  
Marvell → Supplies custom silicon to cloud giants (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud) → Drives data center efficiency and AI workloads → Strengthens customer lock-in and market share.  

This self-reinforcing loop ensures MRVL’s position as a critical supplier in the AI infrastructure boom.  

**Durability Verdict:** Strong — structural advantage in high-growth cloud markets.  

**Part B — Capex Cycle Risk:**  
- **Foundry Dependency:** Fab-lite model with reliance on TSMC, typical for semiconductor suppliers.  
- **CapEx Positioning:** Well-positioned in data center (80% of revenue), less exposed to consumer cyclicality.  
- **Inventory & Digestion:** No reported inventory issues; stable FCF trends suggest efficient management.  

**Severity Rating: LOW** — Diversified customer base and strong cloud demand mitigate capex cycle risks.  

